{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAVE THEM ALL. BECOME THE NEW POPE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are MR DONALD \u2014 a leader who never gives up. The last hope of America and the entire game industry.</strong> Together with Elon, your advisor and coordinator, you must do the impossible: take the Papal throne to save the gamers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/bf83f91eeb9db895b1ab88578414e6f1.poster.avif?t=1761946867\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/bf83f91eeb9db895b1ab88578414e6f1.webm?t=1761946867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/bf83f91eeb9db895b1ab88578414e6f1.mp4?t=1761946867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE VATICAN HAS FALLEN.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A French syndicate has taken power \u2014 a cult of Masons obsessed with monetization and \u201chistorical accuracy.\u201d They hold priests, players, and developers hostage. They experiment on their own employees, forcing them to buy and play their own games.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/11948faeb9ff8681b600cd7edc016fd5.poster.avif?t=1761946867\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/11948faeb9ff8681b600cd7edc016fd5.webm?t=1761946867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR MISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate the heart of the Vatican. Destroy the syndicate. Free the hostages. And take the throne to become the new Pope. The world can\u2019t even afford a remake of a 20-year-old game anymore. Gamedev is drowning. Only you can save it. <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/2cfa4a2f3f9ac21ec54a7bd7c56ed6dc.poster.avif?t=1761946867\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/2cfa4a2f3f9ac21ec54a7bd7c56ed6dc.webm?t=1761946867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/2cfa4a2f3f9ac21ec54a7bd7c56ed6dc.mp4?t=1761946867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HISTORICALLY ACCURATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the developers visited the Vatican in person. Locations were recreated from memory. This is a first-person satirical adventure inspired by the PSX era. <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/50da4b39e9d7af10aa478ecf4cfb4323.poster.avif?t=1761946867\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/50da4b39e9d7af10aa478ecf4cfb4323.webm?t=1761946867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/50da4b39e9d7af10aa478ecf4cfb4323.mp4?t=1761946867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405880?t=1761946867","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761946867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic